_trash":false,"type":"child_page","child_page":{"title":"うるう年の計算が簡単なのって奇跡？"},"request_id":"5b644a45-67f0-46e4-a359-e0adb8a16bda"},"children":[{"object":"block","id":"18d73adb-3263-8014-a553-f06029ce9b90","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"18d73adb-3263-80db-b703-c1e92f76bbfd"},"created_time":"2025-02-01T07:20:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2025-02-01T07:46:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"7efc331f-9b9e-449d-862e-b0eebef23f04"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"7efc331f-9b9e-449d-862e-b0eebef23f04"},"has_children":false,"archived":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"グレゴリオ暦では、時々1年の日数が1日増えて、365日から366日になります。\nこれは実際の地球の公転周期がおよそ365.2421日であるからです。\nもし、1年が365日のまま月日がすぎると、季節がずれることになってしまいます。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"グレゴリオ暦では、時々1年の日数が1日増えて、365日から366日になります。\nこれは実際の地球の公転周期がおよそ365.2421日であるからです。\nもし、1年が365日のまま月日がすぎると、季節がずれることになってしまいます。","href":null}],"color":"default"}},{"object":"block","id":"18d73adb-3263-802a-865a-d5bb7d546a99","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"18d73adb-3263-80db-b703-c1e92f76bbfd"},"created_time":"2025-02-01T07:42:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2025-02-01T07:42:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"7efc331f-9b9e-449d-862e-b0eebef23f04"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"7efc331f-9b9e-449d-862e-b0eebef23f04"},"has_children":false,"archived":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[],"color":"default"}},{"object":"block","id":"18d73adb-3263-8060-813d-c227342d48b2","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"18d73adb-3263-80db-b703-c1e92f76bbfd"},"created_time":"2025-02-01T07:42:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2025-02-01T07:52:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"7efc331f-9b9e-449d-862e-b0eebef23f04"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"7efc331f-9b9e-449d-862e-b0eebef23f04"},"has_children":false,"archived":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"Tips: 実は今年2025年の節分が2/2に移動したのも、このうるう年の影響らしいです。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"Tips: 実は今年2025年の節分が2/2に移動したのも、このうるう年の影響らしいです。","href":null}],"color":"default"}},{"object":"block","id":"18d73adb-3263-802d-ba12-cde1c56c9e00","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"18d73adb-3263-80db-b703-c1e92f76bbfd"},"created_time":"2025-02-01T07:21:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2025-02-01T07:21:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"7efc331f-9b9e-449d-862e-b0eebef23f04"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"7efc331f-9b9e-449d-862e-b0eebef23f04"},"has_children":false,"archived":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[],"color":"default"}},{"object":"block","id":"18d73adb-3263-80bc-8170-ee0157ebfe7c","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"18d73adb-3263-80db-b703-c1e92f76bbfd"},"created_time":"2025-02-01T07:21:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2025-02-01T07:49:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"7efc331f-9b9e-449d-862e-b0eebef23f04"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"7efc331f-9b9e-449d-862e-b0eebef23f04"},"has_children":false,"archived":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"1年のズレを解消するために、グレゴリオ暦では3つのルールで時々1日を挿入します。\n挿入のルールが4 / 100 / 400 と10進数で覚えやすい数値なのは奇跡的じゃない？ という話になりました。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"1年のズレを解消するために、グレゴリオ暦では3つのルールで時々1日を挿入します。\n挿入のルールが4 / 100 / 400 と10進数で覚えやすい数値なのは奇跡的じゃない？ という話になりました。","href":null}],"color":"default"}},{"object":"block","id":"18d73adb-3263-801c-be94-f3a969f49b0d","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"18d73adb-3263-80db-b703-c1e92f76bbfd"},"created_time":"2025-02-01T07:22:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2025-02-01T07:22:00.000Z","created_by":{"objec